 "caption": "Which review matters most: day 1, 3 or 7? Comment your pick \ud83d\udc47\n\nWhy does everything vanish before exam day? The forgetting curve: memory fades fast, then slowly. In a simple model, 3 spaced reviews turn 0.1% into 65% by day 14. Real numbers vary, but spacing really helps.\n\nSave this for exam week.\n\nFollow for one idea a day \u270f\ufe0f\n\n#forgettingcurve #spacedrepetition #studytips #examprep #learnhowtolearn #studygram",
